000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID.    SPOCDESC.
000500 AUTHOR.        KURT MOVSESIAN/JIM COFFMAN (MAINTAINER).
000800
000900***************************************************************
001000*                                                             *
001100*D  S P O C D E S C                                           *
001200*                                                             *
001300*D  THIS SUB PROGRAM DISPLAYS THE PRIMARY AND SECONDARY       *
001400*D  DESCRIPTION AND ALL THE MANUFACTURERS AND PART NUMBERS    *
001500*D  FOR A PARTICULAR CODE.                                    *
001600*D  THE SCREEN GIVES YOU THE CAPABILITY TO SELECT THE DESIRED *
001700*D  MANUFACTURER(S) TO PRINT WHEN PRINTING THE DESCRIPTION    *
001800*D  IN PRIMARY AND SECONDARY LANGUAGE.                        *
001900*                                                             *
002000***************************************************************
002100*   N O T E    T H I S    S U B R O U T I N E   I S           *
002200*          C A L L E D    B Y :                               *
002300*       1. SADDPITM                                           *
002400*       2. SMODSITM                                           *
002500***************************************************************
002600
002700
002800
002900 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
003000 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
003100 SOURCE-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
003200 OBJECT-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
003300
       SPECIAL-NAMES.   I-O-FEEDBACK IS I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT DISPLAY-FILE
                  ASSIGN TO WORKSTATION-ZPURORD-SI
                  ORGANIZATION IS TRANSACTION
                  ACCESS IS SEQUENTIAL
                  FILE STATUS IS DISPLAY-STATUS
                  CONTROL-AREA IS WS-CONTROL.

           SELECT DMANPART-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS3603
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                    WITH DUPLICATES
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT DMANPART-O
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFPCS3600
                  ORGANIZATION IS RELATIVE
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RELATIVE KEY IS RELATIVE-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

003400 DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  DMANPART-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DMANPART-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS  OF MCFLCS3603.

       FD  DMANPART-O
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DMANPART-REC-O.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS  OF MCFPCS3600.
003500
       FD  DISPLAY-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED.
       01  DISPLAY-REC                  PIC X(2000).
      *    COPY DD-POCDESC1-O OF ZPURORD.

003600 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  FILE-STATUS.
           05  FILE-STATUS-1            PIC X  VALUE "0".
           05  FILE-STATUS-2            PIC X  VALUE "0".
003700
       01  RELATIVE-KEY     PIC 9(9).

       COPY IOFEEDBACK OF COPYLIB.

003800**********************
003900*                    *
004000*  S W I T C H E S   *
004100*                    *
004200**********************
004300
004400 01  SWITCH-AREA.
004600     05  DB-ERR-SW               PIC X       VALUE "N".
005000
005100 01  SUB-AREA  COMP-4.
005200     05  SUB                     PIC S99     VALUE ZEROS.
005300     05  DESC-SUB                PIC S9(4) COMP-4 VALUE ZEROS.
005400
005500 01  DMANPART-ADDR-TABLE.
005600     05  DMANPART-ADDR  OCCURS  8 TIMES  PIC S9(9) COMP-4.
005700
005800
005900 01  MESSAGE-BUFFER.
006000     05  MSG-TEXT              PIC X(66)    VALUE SPACE.
006100     05  MSG-FLD               PIC X(10)    VALUE SPACE.
006200     05  MSG-FLD-9  REDEFINES  MSG-FLD      PIC Z(9)9.
006700
006800 01  FIELD-NUMBER              PIC S9(4)    VALUE 1  COMP-4.
006900
007000
       COPY CATREAD IN COPYLIB.

007100**************************************************************
007200**************************************************************
007300**                                                          **
007400**             TERMINAL I/O DATA AREA                       **
007500**                                                          **
007600**************************************************************
007700**************************************************************
007800
007900
008000
008100 01  SCREEN-1.
008200     05  DE1-COMPANY-CODE            PIC X(3).
008300     05  DE1-CODE                    PIC X(7).
008400     05  DE1-DESC1-KEY-ADJ           PIC X(50).
008500     05  DE1-DESC1-TABLE  OCCURS 4 TIMES.
008600         10  DE1-DESC1               PIC X(79).
008700     05  DE1-DESC2-KEY-ADJ           PIC X(50).
008800     05  DE1-DESC2-TABLE  OCCURS 4 TIMES.
008900         10  DE1-DESC2               PIC X(79).
           05  DE1-MANUFACTUR-AREA.
009000         10  DE1-MANUFACTUR-TABLE  OCCURS 8 TIMES.
009100             15  DE1-MANUF-SELECT    PIC X.
009200             15  DE1-MANUF-NAME      PIC X(26).
009300             15  DE1-MANUF-PART-DESC PIC X(4).
009400             15  DE1-MANUF-PART-NO   PIC X(20).
           05  DE1-COMMAND-LINE            PIC X(79).
           05  DE1-MESSAGE-LINE            PIC X(79).
009500
       COPY DISPDATA IN COPYLIB.
009800
009900**************************************************************
010000**************************************************************
010100**                                                          **
010200**                DATABASE I/O BUFFER AREA                  **
010300**                                                          **
010400**************************************************************
010500**************************************************************
010700
010800 COPY DMANPART IN COPYLIB.
010900
011000 COPY DBSTAT IN COPYLIB.
011100
011400
011500*********************
011600*                   *
011700*   DATA SET NAMES  *
011800*                   *
011900*********************
012000
012100 01  DSET-NAMES.
012200     05  DSET-NAME              PIC X(16)  VALUE SPACES.
012300     05  DSET-DMANPART          PIC X(16)  VALUE "DMANPART;".
012400
012500
012600 01 ITEMS-LISTING.
012700     05  ALL-ITEMS              PIC XX    VALUE "@;".
012800     05  CODE-SEARCH            PIC X(10) VALUE "CORP-CODE;".
013100
013200 COPY CDESC IN COPYLIB.
013300
013400 01  RET-CODE                   PIC X(2)  VALUE SPACES.
013500
013600 COPY CFINPTYP IN COPYLIB.
013700
013800
013900
014000*************************************************************
014100**                                                         **
014200**          E R R O R   M E S S A G E   A R E A S          **
014300**                                                         **
014400*************************************************************
014500
014600 COPY TBLOWUP IN COPYLIB.
014800
014900
015000 LINKAGE SECTION.
015100
015200 01  BASE                        PIC X(10).
015300
015400 01  CODE-ARG                    PIC X(8).
015500
015600 COPY VCOMLINK IN COPYLIB.
015700
015800 01  PO-DESC-PARMS.
015900     05  COMPANY-SAVE            PIC X(3).
016000     05  SAVE-MANUFACTUR-DESC    PIC X(26).
016100
016200
016300**************************************
016400*                                    *
016500*  PRINTCNTL IS SET TO 1 THIS CAUSES *
016600*  THE FIELD ON A SCREEN PRINTOUT    *
016700*  TO BE UNDERLINED                  *
016800*                                    *
016900*  PAGECNTL IS SET TO 49 (OCTAL 61)  *
017000*  THIS CAUSE THE LP TO EJECT AFTER  *
017100*  THE SCREEN IS PRINTED             *
017200*                                    *
017300**************************************
017400
017500 01  SCREEN-PRINT-PARMS.
017600     05  PRINTCNTL             PIC S9(4)    COMP-4.
017700     05  PAGECNTL              PIC S9(4)    COMP-4.
017800     05  SPOOLFIL-OPEN-SW      PIC X.
017900
018000 01  PASSED-SPOOL-PRT          PIC S9(2)    COMP-4.
018100
018200 COPY LANGSUB IN COPYLIB.
018300
018400 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING  BASE,
018500                           CODE-ARG,
018600                           VIEW-COMAREA,
018700                           PO-DESC-PARMS,
018800                           SCREEN-PRINT-PARMS,
018900                           PASSED-SPOOL-PRT,
019000                           LANGUAGE-PARMS.
019100
019200
019300 PO-CODE-DESC SECTION 03.
019400
019500 BEGIN-HERE.
           OPEN INPUT DMANPART-I.
           OPEN I-O DMANPART-O, DISPLAY-FILE.

019600     PERFORM 6-MAIN THRU 6-M-X.
019700
           CLOSE DMANPART-I, DMANPART-O, DISPLAY-FILE.
019800     GOBACK.
019900
020000
020100******************************************************
020200**                                                  **
020300**   BLOWUP ROUTINE                                 **
020400**                                                  **
020500******************************************************
020600
020700 2-BLOWUP.
020800     MOVE "SPOCDESC"              TO  BU-PGM-NAME.
020900     MOVE CODE-ARG                TO  BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1).
           IF FILE-STATUS NUMERIC
               MOVE FILE-STATUS TO COND-WORD.
021000     CALL "TBLOWUP" USING BASE, BU-PGM-NAME, STATUS-AREA,
021100         VIEW-COMAREA, FILE-STATUS, BU-DISPLAY-MSG,
021200             BU-DISPLAY-FLDS.
021500
024200
024300 4-PGM-ERROR.
           MOVE B"1" TO IND(FIELD-NUMBER), IND(99).
025100
025200 4-PGM-ERROR-X.
025300     EXIT.
025400
027400
027500 6-MAIN.
027600     PERFORM 61-DISPLAY-ITEM-DESC  THRU  61-DID-X.
027700
027800 6-M-X.
027900     EXIT.
028000
028100
028200
028300 61-DISPLAY-ITEM-DESC.
028400     MOVE "POCDESC1"  TO  VIEW-NFNAME.
029700
029800 61-PUTBUFFER-1.
029900     MOVE SPACES                    TO  SAVE-MANUFACTUR-DESC.
030000     MOVE SPACES                    TO  SCREEN-1.
030100     MOVE COMPANY-SAVE              TO  DE1-COMPANY-CODE.
030200     MOVE CODE-ARG                  TO  DE1-CODE.
030300     PERFORM 611-GET-CODE-DESC  THRU  611-GCD-X.
030400
031200 61-READ-SCREEN-1.
           MOVE SCREEN-1       TO DISPLAY-REC.
           PERFORM 998-WRITE-SCREEN THRU 998-READ-SCREEN.
           MOVE DISPLAY-REC    TO SCREEN-1.

033000     IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 3
033100         GO TO 61-DID-X
033200     ELSE
034600     IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 1 OR
034700        VIEW-LASTKEY = 2 OR
034800        VIEW-LASTKEY = 4 OR
034900        VIEW-LASTKEY = 5 OR
034900        VIEW-LASTKEY = 6 OR
035000        VIEW-LASTKEY = 7 OR
035100        VIEW-LASTKEY = 8
035300*        "INVALID FUNCTION KEY ENTERED"
035400         MOVE   9 TO LANG-SETNUM
035500         MOVE  10 TO LANG-MSGNUM
035600         PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
               MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO DE1-MESSAGE-LINE
035700         MOVE 58 TO  FIELD-NUMBER
035800         PERFORM 4-PGM-ERROR  THRU  4-PGM-ERROR-X
035900         GO TO 61-READ-SCREEN-1.
036000
038000
038100     PERFORM 621-SAVE-MANUF-SELECTIONS  THRU  621-SMS-X.
038200     IF DB-ERR-SW = "Y"
               MOVE ALL SPACES TO DE1-MANUFACTUR-AREA
               PERFORM 611-GET-CODE-DESC  THRU 611-GCD-X
038300         GO TO 61-READ-SCREEN-1.
038400
038500 61-DID-X.
038600     EXIT.
038700
038800
038900 611-GET-CODE-DESC.
039000     MOVE 5                       TO  CDESC-LINES-TO-GET.
           MOVE "P"                     TO  CDESC-LANGUAGE-OPTION.
039100     MOVE "D"                     TO  CDESC-DESC-OPTION.
           MOVE "S"                     TO  CDESC-MANUFACT-OPTION.
039200     MOVE "N"                     TO  CDESC-LOCAL-DESC-OPTION.
039300     CALL "CDESC" USING RET-CODE,
039400                        BASE,
039500                        STATUS-AREA,
039600                        BU-DISPLAY-MSG,
039700                        CODE-ARG,
039800                        CDESC-DATA.
039900     MOVE ZERO                    TO  SUB,
040000                                      DESC-SUB.
040100
040200 611-LOAD-PRIMARY.
040300     ADD 1  TO  SUB.
040400     IF SUB > CDESC-LINES-GOT  OR
040500        DESC-SUB > 4
040600         GO TO 611-FIND-SECONDARY-DESC.
040700     IF SUB = 1
040800         MOVE CDESC (SUB)         TO  DE1-DESC1-KEY-ADJ
040900     ELSE
041000         ADD 1                    TO  DESC-SUB
041100         MOVE CDESC (SUB)         TO  DE1-DESC1 (DESC-SUB).
041200
041300     GO TO 611-LOAD-PRIMARY.
041400
041500 611-FIND-SECONDARY-DESC.
041600     MOVE "S"                     TO  CDESC-LANGUAGE-OPTION.
041700     CALL "CDESC" USING RET-CODE,
041800                        BASE,
041900                        STATUS-AREA,
042000                        BU-DISPLAY-MSG,
042100                        CODE-ARG,
042200                        CDESC-DATA.
042300     IF BU-DISPLAY-MSG-1  NOT = SPACES
042400         MOVE "SECONDARY"         TO  BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2)
042500         GO TO 2-BLOWUP.
042600
042700     MOVE ZEROS                   TO  SUB,
042800                                      DESC-SUB.
042900
043000 611-LOAD-SECONDARY.
043100     ADD 1  TO  SUB.
043200     IF SUB > CDESC-LINES-GOT  OR
043300        DESC-SUB > 4
043400         GO TO 611-FIND-MANUFACT.
043500     IF SUB = 1
043600         MOVE CDESC (SUB)         TO  DE1-DESC2-KEY-ADJ
043700     ELSE
043800         ADD 1                    TO  DESC-SUB
043900         MOVE CDESC (SUB)         TO  DE1-DESC2 (DESC-SUB).
044000
044100     GO TO 611-LOAD-SECONDARY.
044200
044300 611-FIND-MANUFACT.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           MOVE CODE-ARG TO CORPCDE OF DMANPART-REC-I.
           START DMANPART-I KEY = CORPCDE OF DMANPART-REC-I
               INVALID KEY MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
                   MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD
               ELSE
                   MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.
044400*A   CALL "DBFIND" USING BASE, DSET-DMANPART, MODE1,
044500*A       STATUS-AREA, CODE-SEARCH, CODE-ARG.
044600     IF COND-WORD NOT = 0
044700         MOVE "FIND MANUFACT *611-FM" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
044800         GO TO 2-BLOWUP.
044900
045000     PERFORM 6111-RESET-ADDR-TABLE  THRU  6111-RAT-X
045100         VARYING SUB FROM 1 BY 1
045200             UNTIL SUB > 8.
045300
045400     MOVE ZEROS                           TO  SUB.
045500
045600 611-GET-DMANPART.
045700     ADD 1                                TO  SUB.
045800     IF SUB > 8
045900         GO TO 611-GCD-X.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           READ DMANPART-I NEXT INTO BUF-DMANPART
               AT END MOVE 15 TO COND-WORD.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               IF FILE-STATUS = "10" OR "14" OR "46"
                   MOVE 15 TO COND-WORD
               ELSE
                   MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.
           IF CORPCDE OF DMANPART-REC-I NOT = CODE-ARG
               MOVE 15 TO COND-WORD.
046000*A   CALL "DBGET" USING BASE, DSET-DMANPART, MODE5,
046100*A       STATUS-AREA, ALL-ITEMS, BUF-DMANPART, CODE-ARG.
046200     IF COND-WORD NOT = 0
046300         IF COND-WORD = 15
046400             GO TO 611-GCD-X
046500         ELSE
046600             MOVE "GET DMANPART *611-GD" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
046700             GO TO 2-BLOWUP.
046800
046900     MOVE MAN-PARTNO-SELECT      TO  DE1-MANUF-SELECT (SUB).
047000     MOVE MAN-NAME               TO  DE1-MANUF-NAME (SUB).
047100     MOVE MAN-PARTNO             TO  DE1-MANUF-PART-NO (SUB).
047200     MOVE MAN-PARTNO-TYPE        TO  CFINPTYP-TYPE-DB.
047300     CALL "CFINPTYP" USING CFINPTYP-PARMS.
047400     MOVE "N"                    TO  CFINPTYP-1ST-CALL.
047500     MOVE CFINPTYP-TYPE-SHORT    TO  DE1-MANUF-PART-DESC (SUB).
047600*    MOVE REC-NO                 TO  DMANPART-ADDR (SUB).
           ACCEPT IOFEEDBACK FROM I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA.
           MOVE IO-REL-NO              TO  DMANPART-ADDR (SUB).
047700     GO TO 611-GET-DMANPART.
047800
047900 611-GCD-X.
048000     EXIT.
048100
048200 6111-RESET-ADDR-TABLE.
048300     MOVE ZEROS                   TO  DMANPART-ADDR (SUB).
048400
048500 6111-RAT-X.
048600     EXIT.
048700
048800
048900****************************************************
049000*
049100*  THIS ROUTINE SAVES THE MANUFACTURER SELECTIONS
049200*  MADE ON THE SCREEN IN THE APPROPRIATE  FIELD
049300*  IN DMANPART
049400*
049500*   THE FOLLOWING ARE THE SELECTION INDICATORS THE
049600*   USERS CAN USE WHEN SELECTING MANUFACTURERS
049700*    B - (BOTH) PRINT THIS MANUFACTURER WHEN PRINTING
049800*        CODE IN PRIMARY AND SECONDARY LANGUAGE
049900*    P - (PRIMARY) PRINT THIS MANUFACTURER WHEN
050000*        PRINTING CODE IN PRIMARY LANGUAGE ONLY
050100*    S - (SECONDARY) PRINT THIS MANUFACTURER WHEN
050200*        PRINTING CODE IN SECONDARY LANGUAGE ONLY
050300*
050400****************************************************
050500
050600 621-SAVE-MANUF-SELECTIONS.
050700     MOVE "N"                     TO  DB-ERR-SW.
050800     MOVE ZEROS                   TO  SUB.
051800
051900 621-GET-DMANPART-CALC.
052000     ADD 1                        TO  SUB.
052100     IF SUB > 8
052200         GO TO 621-SMS-X          .
052300     IF DMANPART-ADDR (SUB) = ZEROS
052400         GO TO 621-SMS-X
052500     ELSE
052600         MOVE DMANPART-ADDR (SUB) TO RELATIVE-KEY.
052700
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           READ DMANPART-O INTO BUF-DMANPART
               INVALID KEY MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD.
           IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
               MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD
           ELSE
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.
052800*    CALL "DBGET" USING BASE, DSET-DMANPART, MODE4,
052900*        STATUS-AREA, ALL-ITEMS, BUF-DMANPART, CALC-ADDR.
053000     IF COND-WORD NOT = 0
053100         IF COND-WORD = 12 OR 13 OR 17
053200             PERFORM 6211-WRITE-REPROCESS-MSG  THRU  6211-WRM-X
053300             GO TO 621-SMS-X
053400         ELSE
053500             MOVE "GET DMANPART *621-GDC" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
053600             GO TO 2-BLOWUP.
053700
053800     IF MAN-CORPCODE  NOT = CODE-ARG  OR
053900        MAN-NAME NOT = DE1-MANUF-NAME (SUB)
054000         PERFORM 6211-WRITE-REPROCESS-MSG  THRU  6211-WRM-X
054100         GO TO 621-SMS-X          .
054200
054300     IF DE1-MANUF-SELECT (SUB) = MAN-PARTNO-SELECT
054400         GO TO 621-GET-DMANPART-CALC
054500     ELSE
054600         MOVE DE1-MANUF-SELECT (SUB)  TO  MAN-PARTNO-SELECT.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           REWRITE DMANPART-REC-O FROM BUF-DMANPART
               INVALID KEY MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.
054700*A   CALL "DBUPDATE" USING BASE, DSET-DMANPART, MODE1,
054800*A       STATUS-AREA, ALL-ITEMS, BUF-DMANPART.
054900     IF COND-WORD NOT = 0
055000         MOVE "UPDATE MSTORERM * 621-GDC" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
055100         GO TO 2-BLOWUP.
055200
055300     GO TO 621-GET-DMANPART-CALC.
055400
056200 621-SMS-X.
056300     EXIT.
056400
056500
056600*************************************************************
056700*
056800*  THIS ROUTINE IS CALLED WHEN TO PRINT A MESSAGE TO TELL THE
056900*  USER TO REPROCESS MANUFACTURER SELECTIONS SINCE THE
057000*  MANUFACTURERS HAVE BEEN UPDATED WHILE THIS SCREEN WAS UP.
057100*  THIS IS DETERMINE BY SAVING THE RECORD ADDRESSES WHEN
057200*  DISPLAYING THE SCREEN AND THEN GETTING A BAD COND-WORD
057300*  (12,13,17) OR THE WRONG MANUFACTURER WHEN GETTING THE
057400*  RECORD FOR UPDATE.
057500*
057600*************************************************************
057700
057800 6211-WRITE-REPROCESS-MSG.
057900     MOVE "Y"                     TO  DB-ERR-SW.
058000     MOVE 18                      TO  LANG-SETNUM.
058100     MOVE 10                      TO  LANG-MSGNUM.
058200**  REPROCESS SELECTIONS - MANUFACTURERS HAVE BEEN UPDATED
058300     PERFORM 999-CATREAD  THRU  999-CATREAD-EXIT.
           MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER          TO  DE1-MESSAGE-LINE.
058400     MOVE 58                      TO  FIELD-NUMBER.
058500     PERFORM 4-PGM-ERROR  THRU  4-PGM-ERROR-X.
058600
058700 6211-WRM-X.
058800     EXIT.
058900
       COPY DISPCALL IN COPYLIB.
059100
059200 999-CATREAD.
           IF CATREAD-MSG-NUMBER = ZEROS
               MOVE LANG-SETNUM TO CATREAD-MSG-SET
               MOVE LANG-MSGNUM TO CATREAD-MSG-NUM.
           CALL "CCATREAD" USING CATREAD-PARMS.
           MOVE CATREAD-MSG-TEXT TO MESSAGE-BUFFER.
060700 999-CATREAD-EXIT.
060800     EXIT.
